<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-056-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.298008" lon="-120.925736"><name>SC26-056-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.5 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 67/100; not catch probability. Center 170 ft; nearby 166–189 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-039</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.30120739003538" lon="-120.92570954537173"/><trkpt lat="35.30085449058763" lon="-120.92615842332212"/><trkpt lat="35.30049027643874" lon="-120.92594778683349"/><trkpt lat="35.30013737589523" lon="-120.92639665967097"/><trkpt lat="35.299416490098196" lon="-120.92641505754474"/><trkpt lat="35.299241924063416" lon="-120.92674940714892"/><trkpt lat="35.29960613689764" lon="-120.92696004435204"/><trkpt lat="35.29960990633552" lon="-120.92717987890929"/><trkpt lat="35.29925134778268" lon="-120.92729899108271"/><trkpt lat="35.29888525077981" lon="-120.92697843686834"/><trkpt lat="35.29853988244195" lon="-120.92786695967337"/><trkpt lat="35.298355892720686" lon="-120.9276517243994"/><trkpt lat="35.29772888494363" lon="-120.92788764134514"/><trkpt lat="35.29763312200534" lon="-120.92756019528471"/><trkpt lat="35.29708491966595" lon="-120.9271343291684"/><trkpt lat="35.29682589259539" lon="-120.92780070643879"/><trkpt lat="35.296463565238994" lon="-120.9276999850306"/><trkpt lat="35.29593231869643